= Research data management — Technical =

A data-management plan should connect data types and volumes to documentation, standards, storage, preservation, access, reuse, oversight, and lifecycle responsibilities. In 2026 NIH simplified the required DMS Plan format while retaining the underlying 2023 policy.

== Modeling / implementation cautions ==
* research data management ≠ data sharing only
* managed data ≠ open data necessarily
* backup ≠ long-term preservation

== References ==
* NIH, ''Final Policy for Data Management and Sharing'', effective 25 January 2023.
* NIH, updated 2026 Data Management and Sharing Plan format and implementation guidance.
* Wilkinson et al. (2016), FAIR Guiding Principles.
